      "grounding": "measured",
      "precision_class": "advisory",
      "failure_scenario": "The VERDICT.md explicitly states 'Numbers are aggregate tok/s medians', meaning quoting 77.8 misrepresents the true median of 75.7, which breaks trust in the report.",
