      "failure_scenario": "Readers will mistakenly trust unverified numbers because the report falsely portrays them as backed by a hard receipt (e.g. 'receipt: evidence/reports/...'), breaking the audit chain for unreceipted figures.",
      "source": "agy gemini-3.1-pro-high on a444816b1: ",
      "excerpt": "",
      "excerpt_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "disposition": "fixed in 4ca8f95cf on the PR branch: the 15 report lines that cite only the provenance index now read 'UNRECEIPTED [C] \u2014 provenance only: evidence/reports/...' or name the non-measurement source on the line itself; check_no_claim_literals.sh still PASS",
      "agy_id": "laundering-unreceipted-figures",
      "baselineState": "new"
